1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,060
The first promise was made while the water was still high, and it was almost too simple to be believed: the field station would measure the river from the north bank and the east bank at the same time.

2
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:21,164
“A couple of gauges are not a system,” the director said, “but they are a step, and we need a step.”

3
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:28,587
The natural sciences had a different language from the local one, and the difference was nearly a gulf.

4
00:00:28,587 --> 00:00:44,744
“You bring me ice and temperature and a computer program,” a farmer said, “and I bring you an ear for what the water is doing.” The geologist agreed, and the two of them began to write the same list.

5
00:00:44,744 --> 00:00:56,131
The kit was odd but distinct: a spade, a cage of bamboo for the bank, a permit for the pit, and a gentle hose that could bake nothing but mud.

6
00:00:56,131 --> 00:01:02,950
“Contrary to the report, the tiger and the bee are not the problem,” the farmer said.

7
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:05,759
“The weed is.”

8
00:01:05,759 --> 00:01:17,302
The insight that followed was accidental, and it was a matter of soda and onion: the samples had been taken from a picnic spot where the water was barely moving.

9
00:01:17,302 --> 00:01:26,425
A survivor of the last flood described the swell at the mouth of the drain, and the team wrote it down as a source.

10
00:01:26,425 --> 00:01:42,926
The promise was to breed a small, boring, useful habit: one reading a day, at the same hour, from a vegetarian cook, a hen keeper, and a beekeeper, all of them equipped with the same cheap kit.

11
00:01:42,926 --> 00:01:53,129
“Nutrient levels and shrimp counts are fine,” the director said, “but the data has to come from the people who live on the bank.”

12
00:01:53,129 --> 00:01:59,738
The altitude of the station explained nothing and the technology explained everything else.

13
00:01:59,738 --> 00:02:09,716
By the end of the week, the promise had a shape: five families, one form, and a register that nobody could quietly correct.

14
00:02:09,716 --> 00:02:19,944
The essence of it was naturally boring: a drink of water, a bowl of peas, and a pipe of tobacco were the farmer's whole diet.

15
00:02:19,944 --> 00:02:31,571
A deaf neighbour and a criminal record in one family made the map of the district stranger than a church or a god, and the new readings were similar to the ones from the east bank.

16
00:02:31,571 --> 00:02:36,948
A pop of static from the radio ended the meeting.
